@page "/projects/aichess"

<div class="container">
    <h3>AIChess</h3>
    
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-8">
            <p>
                This is an AI-powered chess application built with Python and JavaScript. 
                The project demonstrates artificial intelligence algorithms for chess gameplay, 
                including move generation, position evaluation, and strategic decision-making.
            </p>
            
            <h4>Key Features:</h4>
            <ul>
                <li>AI opponent with configurable difficulty levels</li>
                <li>Interactive chess board interface</li>
                <li>Move validation and game rule enforcement</li>
                <li>Position analysis and evaluation</li>
                <li>Game history and replay functionality</li>
            </ul>
            
            <h4>Technologies Used:</h4>
            <ul>
                <li>Python for AI logic and game engine</li>
                <li>JavaScript for frontend interactivity</li>
                <li>Chess algorithms (minimax, alpha-beta pruning)</li>
                <li>Position evaluation heuristics</li>
            </ul>
            
            <div class="mt-4">
                <a href="https://github.com/DontDoThat21/AIChess.git" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank">
                    <i class="fa fa-github"></i> View on GitHub
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="text-center">
                <img src="/Images/project/aiChess.png" 
                     alt="AIChess Project Screenshot" 
                     class="img-fluid border rounded shadow"
                     style="max-width: 100%; height: auto;" />
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

